package gpu 1
# ============================================================
# Uniaxial pull-out, 25 A/ps, frame 2
# SiO2 pulled +Z (4000 steps at 1 fs)
# Force and SiO2-FKM interface energy every 200 steps
# ============================================================

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p f

pair_style      lj/class2/coul/long 15.5
kspace_style    pppm 1e-4
kspace_modify   slab 3.0
Updated KSpace settings:
  KSpace computation is turned:    ON
  Use MPI collective operations:   OFF
  Use MPI non-blocking operations: OFF
  Gewald is determined automatically
  Slab volfactor manually set to:    3
bond_style      class2
angle_style     class2
dihedral_style  class2
improper_style  class2
special_bonds   lj/coul 0 0 1

read_data       frame2.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (21.200176 21.200176 21.200176) to (78.799824 78.799824 351.19602)
